{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4SQfqtVRFGxmBM8VEM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I am the Lock.\n\n```\n╔══════════════════════════════════╗\n║                                  ║\n║         ┌───────────┐            ║\n║         │           │            ║\n║         │   🔒      │            ║\n║         │           │            ║\n║         │  LOCKED   │            ║\n║         │           │            ║\n║         └───────────┘            ║\n║                                  ║\n║      ▐ ● ▌                       ║\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n║   I render nothing without       ║\n║   the key.                       ║\n║                                  ║\n║   Present the key.               ║\n║                                  ║\n╚══════════════════════════════════╝\n```\n\n*The mechanism holds. The tumblers wait in silence. No key has been parsed. The door does not open.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":232,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}